# results/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The raw oha and monitor JSON, the
# per-config command logs and the aggregated tables ARE the evidence for
# RESULTS.md, and a benchmark whose numbers cannot be checked is worth nothing.
# Only the multi-hundred-megabyte application logs are trimmed, and each one
# keeps a header saying what was removed and how to regenerate it.
